OL,3,GNEWSAWhipsnade lion to be lit weekly
OL,4,Auntil end of year
OL,5,
OL,6,FA chalk lion carved into a hillside
OL,7,Fwill be illuminated every week for the
OL,8,Frest of the year to mark the Zoological
OL,9,FSociety of London's (ZSL) 200th
OL,10,Fanniversary.
OL,12,FWhipsnade Zoo's 147m-long (483ft) white
OL,13,Flion will be lit every Wednesday
OL,14,Fthroughout autumn and winter.
OL,16,FIn total 2,330 bulbs were used to light
OL,17,Fup the lion's outline on Wednesday. It
OL,18,Fhad previously been lit for special
OL,19,Foccasions such as Whipsnade Zoo's 50th
OL,20,Fanniversary in 1981.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
