OL,3,GNEWSAWhipsnade lion to be lit weekly
OL,4,Auntil end of year
OL,5,
OL,6,FOwen Craft, director of zoo operations
OL,7,Fat Whipsnade Zoo, said the lit-up lion
OL,8,Fis "shining a beacon of light on
OL,9,Fwildlife conservation".
